    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "TLS 處理通訊通道，HTTP 處理應用程式語義",
          "text": "TLS 會保護用戶端與伺服器之間的通訊通道，並驗證憑證名稱、有效期限和信任鏈等項目。如果 TLS 驗證失敗，連線通常會在傳送 HTTP 要求之前停止。",
          "words": 43
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "TLS 處理通訊通道，HTTP 處理應用程式語義",
          "text": "HTTP 定義要求方法、URI、狀態碼和本文的意義。404 回應表示處理 HTTP 要求後找不到目標資源。這與 TLS 失敗或 DNS 失敗不在同一層。",
          "words": 48
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "TLS 處理通訊通道，HTTP 處理應用程式語義",
          "text": "排查 HTTPS 故障時，應從已取得的觀測結果開始。若憑證名稱不相符，請調查 TLS；若出現 404，請調查 HTTP 路由或應用程式資源，不要反覆修改已經成功的階段。",
          "words": 41
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 48,
      "id": "fundamentals.networking-basics:section:http-tls:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "TLS 處理通訊通道，HTTP 處理應用程式語義",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "http-tls"
      ],
      "sectionId": "http-tls",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.networking-basics",
      "position": 16,
      "remainingSteps": 23,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "情況",
          "text": "瀏覽器顯示 orders.example 的憑證名稱不相符，但不顯示 HTTP 狀態碼。",
          "words": 16
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 1",
          "text": "確認名稱解析結果和連線目標是否符合預期。",
          "words": 13
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 2",
          "text": "檢查憑證的 SAN/CN、有效期限和信任鏈。",
          "words": 10
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 23,
      "id": "fundamentals.networking-basics:section:http-tls:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具體範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "http-tls"
      ],
      "sectionId": "http-tls",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.networking-basics",
      "position": 17,
      "remainingSteps": 22,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 3",
          "text": "只有在 TLS 驗證成功後，才調查 HTTP 路徑和狀態碼。",
          "words": 15
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "結論",
          "text": "不要將憑證問題當作 HTTP 404 處理；可以在 TLS 階段修正此問題。",
          "words": 15
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.networking-basics:section:http-tls:example:2",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具體範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
