        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:misconception:claim",
          "kind": "misconception",
          "label": "這是錯誤的",
          "text": "如果 HTTPS 回傳 404，TLS 憑證也一定已損壞。",
          "words": 13
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:http-tls:misconception:correction",
          "kind": "correction",
          "label": "更正",
          "text": "404 是 TLS 成功後的 HTTP 回應。憑證驗證和 HTTP 資源探索是不同的失敗階段。",
          "words": 21
        }
      ],
